pbeat rock music fool me  lightheartedness isn't the basic problem  that needs to be fixed here the overused  and unearned moment is DC's greatest foe  hey guys you know I couldn't resist  doing a video on Superman I just care is  this there's a new nerdwriter video  every Wednesday so if you go right there  and click that and subscribe to this  channel you'll get all of them that  really helps me out  I got a thank Squarespace for helping to  sponsor this video they helped to fund  this channel without interfering in the  content which is just so awesome  they make sleek intuitive websites you  don't have to know coding if you sign up  for a year you can get a free domain  name and if you use the offer code  nerdwriter at squarespace.com you can  get 10% off your first purchase which is  cool if you want to make a website thank  you guys so much I'll see you next  Wednesday
 

